      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This sounds like exactly the type of instance most people I know would use. I can't count how many times I and others have been 1) Pestered by someone for being in a Friends instance of someone they don't know, and 2) Leaving a Friends+ instance because of the amount of total strangers there are.\nAsking \"who are those people?\" only to hear \"I don't know\" from half the room is not something I enjoy.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
